# NOTICE

## HMMT February 2026 data

This pack contains all **33 short-answer problems** of the **HMMT February 2026** tournament (Harvard-MIT Mathematics Tournament, February 14, 2026 sitting): the Algebra & Number Theory, Combinatorics and Geometry individual rounds (10 problems each) and three short-answer problems from the Team round (numbers 2, 3 and 5).

The problems are competition material of the **Harvard-MIT Mathematics Tournament (HMMT)**, a student-run tournament organised by students of Harvard University and the Massachusetts Institute of Technology. They are included here as republished by a public evaluation mirror, not directly from an HMMT file.

